WEBVTT

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.740
Kasuga-kun,

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:17.200
I trusted you...

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.280
I believed you would drop your mask,

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.440
and follow me to the other side.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:35.260
Liar.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:49.620
Nakamura-san!

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.400
Nakamura-san!

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.810
<i>Nakamura-san...</i>

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:29.000
<i>Nakamura-san was mad at me because...</i>

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.170
<i>I get it now.</i>

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:35.340
<i>Nakamura-san was hurt!</i>

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.380
<i>I will write an essay!</i>

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:50.200
<i>I won't let Nakamura-san be alone!</i>

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:08.520
<b>Flowers of Evil</b>

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:08.520
<b>Episode 12 of 13</b>

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.930
Nakamura-san, wait...

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.180
I'm a shit-face...

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:52.610
A total shit-face!

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:56.570
Was there something you needed?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:13.810
<b>Nakamura-san, I'm sorry. 

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.210
Pork buns, I can understand,

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:14.510
but oden stew during the summer is crazy.

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:17.140
That's just wrong...

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:20.170
That convenience store sells weird stuff.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:23.350
Like snacks that I've never 
seen advertised before.

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:25.090
Yeah, that's true.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:26.530
You know,

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.950
I found something really cute 
at that store the other day.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.060
What was it?

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.740
This cute pink lip gloss...

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:35.490
I bought it.

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:38.830
Wow, that took guts!

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:52.010
Good morning, Nakamura-san.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.540
Look who's here...

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:01.150
Morning.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.540
Just look at his eyes, man.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.330
Knock on wood he stays away.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:32.220
That one clerk was so hot...

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.330
Don't you agree?

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:34.300
Yeah.

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:46.430
Okay, that's it for announcements.

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:47.400
Class monitor?

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:48.720
Stand.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.470
Bow.

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:54.990
Goodbye.

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:57.210
All right!

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.420
Wanna go somewhere?

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.060
Sorry about that...

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.470
Hey, guys...

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:36.460
Huh?

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:39.020
What's up with Kasuga?

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:42.260
He's been acting weird, hasn't he?

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:43.290
Any idea?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.390
Huh?

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:46.140
How would we know?

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:48.770
Aren't you and Kasuga friends?

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.200
You must have some idea.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:51.170
Spit it out.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.900
Well...

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:58.790
He hasn't been reading his books anymore, lately.

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:01.600
He used to spend every free second with a book.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.050
I just don't get that guy!

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:05.480
Talk about creepy!

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:07.870
Ai-chan?

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:09.430
Let's go.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.400
O-Okay...

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:41.140
Nakamura-san!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.590
Nakamura-san, wait...

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:48.240
Wait up!

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.310
Nakamura-san!

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.390
I...

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.410
I wrote an essay...

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:07.870
Remember the promise we made?

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:14.540
Please read it...

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:16.910
Read it, please!

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.480
W-Wait...

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:33.960
I get it!

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:35.720
I'll read it to you.

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:37.550
I'll read it aloud, so listen!

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:40.490
"Nakamura-san, I'm sorry.

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
For everything I said up on the mountain,

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:48.580
for not going to the other side with you.

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:52.160
I finally realize now...

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:55.770
I must have really hurt you!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.690
I never stopped to consider it...

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.180
I was only thinking about myself.

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.520
I'm a shit-face...

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:07.370
A total shit-face!

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:10.810
You've probably lost interest in me.

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:13.610
But I'll do my best.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:16.520
I'll do my best to be a real pervert!

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.700
I won't let you be alone!

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.280
If I did that,

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:24.280
I'd regret it for the rest of my life!"

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:28.790
Look out!

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:29.960
Watch where you're going!

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:32.250
Let's go.

00:11:58.810 --> 00:11:59.890
Takao?

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:07.620
Takao, where are you going?

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.270
Cut it out...

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:23.630
That's my fried chicken.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.390
Delicious fried chicken...

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:25.390
Bastard!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.680
Then give me some of your snacks!

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.790
Forget it.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.700
What are you doing?

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.080
Bastard!

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.480
Hand it over!

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:47.830
<b>Nakamura</b>

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:35.620
<b>To Nakamura-san</b>

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:47.880
Was there something you needed?

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:50.300
O-Oh...

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.910
My name is Kasuga.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:58.650
A-And I'm very sorry for what 
happened the other day!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.990
F-For when Nakamura...

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:06.350
Sawa-san and I

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.530
went up the mountain...

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:14.230
I'm sorry for making everyone worry.

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:23.750
So you're Kasuga-kun?

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.010
It's okay. Raise your head.

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:32.720
Did you come here to apologize?

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:42.940
Would you like to come in?

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.070
No, that's...

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:51.660
This is the first time a friend 
of Sawa's has visited.

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:55.080
I don't think Sawa's home yet,

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:56.950
but why not come in?

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.350
I'm home.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.160
Excuse the intrusion...

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:00.480
Hey, you can relax.

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:02.370
Okay.

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:06.570
Sorry it's so messy in here.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:07.730
It's fine.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:17.800
Ah...

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:20.080
You're a friend of Sawa's?

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:23.120
Nice to meet you, I'm Kasuga.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:25.500
It's nice to meet you.

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:28.590
Gran, bring me a beer.

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:30.210
Sure.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:45.680
Say, Kasuga-kun...

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.230
What is your impression of Sawa?

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.320
Eh?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.670
Girls can be difficult...

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:05.720
Even as her father, I'm ashamed 
to admit I don't understand her.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.330
She rarely opens her mouth, and 
when she does, it's only cursing...

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.060
Where did she learn that language?

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:18.460
And she stays out very late.

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.590
She won't listen to a word I say.

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:27.370
Honestly, I wonder who she takes after...

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:38.040
Here you go.

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:38.980
Oh...

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.200
Thank you.

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:48.120
Um... What about her mother?

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.960
Yeah...

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.580
She isn't around.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:59.350
We divorced when Sawa was five.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:01.610
I'm sorry.

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:05.060
It's fine. Listen...

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:06.740
I was wondering...

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:12.400
What is your relationship with Sawa?

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.330
I don't know.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.370
Friends...

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.250
We're friends, I guess.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:30.030
Honestly, I'm not sure what Nakamura...

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:33.550
What Sawa-san is thinking.

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:35.640
Still...

00:18:37.890 --> 00:18:42.010
I want to understand her.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:58.610
You're an honest boy, Kasuga-kun.

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:03.100
Well, it's almost time for dinner.

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:04.120
Would you like to join us?

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.020
Huh?

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:06.580
No, that's okay.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:09.430
Well, you came all the way out here.

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:12.380
And Sawa should be home soon.

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:15.550
I'll call your parents to let them know.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.800
I'm sorry...

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.430
It's no trouble.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:29.200
Uh, may I use the restroom?

00:19:51.830 --> 00:20:02.590
<b>Keep out, shit-faces!</b>

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:25.850
Oh, hello?

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:28.290
Is this Kasuga-san?

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:30.830
I'm Nakamura.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:33.120
Yes, hello.

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:35.660
Oh, not at all.

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:38.140
Right now, Kasuga-kun is over at our house.

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:39.360
Yes.

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:44.300
No, it's no trouble at all.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:50.630
Well, since he came all this way,

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:52.960
I've invited him to stay for dinner...

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:36.060
Nakamura-san...

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>So long! So long! 
You're all shit-faces! 
